{
  "title": { "zh": "双重否定律" },
  "tray": "proof",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "两句话能互相推出，说的就是同一件事，这叫<wiki-ref to=\"equivalence\"></wiki-ref>。「¬¬下雨」和「下雨」就是一对。"
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "两个方向都证出后，合成一个元件，元件上切换方向。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "c-dneg_1",
      "kind": "proof",
      "step": { "zh": "去掉两个 ¬" },
      "tests": [{ "premises": { "p": "¬¬A" }, "goal": "A" }],
      "cases": [{ "A": "Rain" }, { "A": "Locked" }],
      "hint": [{ "zh": "手里有一条规则正好去掉两个 ¬。" }],
      "solution": ["r = raa(p)", "goal <- r"]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-dneg_2",
      "kind": "proof",
      "step": { "zh": "加上两个 ¬" },
      "tests": [{ "premises": { "p": "A" }, "goal": "¬¬A" }],
      "cases": [{ "A": "Rain" }, { "A": "Locked" }],
      "hint": [{ "zh": "「¬¬下雨」就是「¬下雨 → ⊥」。" }],
      "solution": ["f = impI[A=\"~A\"](body: m) {", "  body {", "    m = mp(f.body, p)", "  }", "}", "goal <- f"]
    }
  ]
}
